      "subtopic": "Linear Motion",
      "question": "A body moving with an initial velocity of 10 m/s accelerates uniformly at 4 m/s² for 5 seconds. Calculate the total distance travelled.",
      "options": {
        "A": "100 m",
        "B": "50 m",
        "C": "150 m",
        "D": "75 m"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Using s = ut + ½at²: s = (10)(5) + 0.5(4)(5²) = 50 + 50 = 100 m.",
      "explanation_short": "s = ut + ½at² = 50 + 50 = 100 m.",
      "explanation_pidgin": "Use s = ut + ½at²: (10×5) + ½(4)(25) = 50 + 50 = 100 m."
    }
  ]
